\�M���ئ!�W���G7]��k����EK�֟�%}ר�0�c������������}{"schema":1,"expires":1808783999,"releases":[{"version":"1.2.22","firmware":"4.4","channel":"stable","url":"https://github.com/Neme77/centauri-carbon-2-community/releases/download/CC2-Control-1.2.22-V4.4/CC2-Control-1.2.22-V4.4.cc2update","size":6308246,"notes":"New Dashboard/Control, external-spool Load/Unload without Canvas, optional Spoolman, remember LAN code, print completion, spool-history filters and experimental timed bed heating. Camera included: full reboot only on first activation; already active since 1.2.19 or firmware V4.4.2.","notes_i18n":{"en":"New Dashboard/Control, external-spool Load/Unload without Canvas, optional Spoolman, remember LAN code, print completion, spool-history filters and experimental timed bed heating. Camera included: full reboot only on first activation; already active since 1.2.19 or firmware V4.4.2.","it":"Nuovi Dashboard/Controllo, bobina esterna senza Canvas, Spoolman facoltativo, salvataggio codice LAN, fine stampa, filtri consumi e riscaldamento piatto temporizzato sperimentale. Webcam inclusa: riavvio completo solo alla prima attivazione; già attiva da 1.2.19 o firmware V4.4.2.","fr":"Dashboard/Contrôle renouvelés, bobine externe sans Canvas, Spoolman optionnel, code LAN mémorisé, fin d’impression, filtres et chauffage temporisé expérimental. Caméra incluse: redémarrage complet uniquement à la première activation; déjà active depuis 1.2.19 ou V4.4.2.","es":"Dashboard/Control renovados, bobina externa sin Canvas, Spoolman opcional, código LAN guardado, aviso final, filtros y calentamiento temporizado experimental. Cámara incluida: reinicio completo solo en la primera activación; ya activa desde 1.2.19 o V4.4.2.","pl":"Nowy Dashboard/Sterowanie, zewnętrzna szpula bez Canvas, opcjonalny Spoolman, zapis kodu LAN, koniec druku, filtry i eksperymentalne grzanie czasowe. Kamera: restart tylko przy pierwszej aktywacji; już aktywna od 1.2.19 lub V4.4.2.","cs":"Nový Dashboard/Ovládání, externí cívka bez Canvas, volitelný Spoolman, uložení LAN kódu, dokončení tisku, filtry a experimentální časovaný ohřev. Kamera: restart jen při první aktivaci; již aktivní od 1.2.19 nebo V4.4.2.","hu":"Új Dashboard/Vezérlés, külső tekercs Canvas nélkül, választható Spoolman, LAN-kód mentése, nyomtatási értesítés, szűrők és kísérleti időzített fűtés. Kamera: újraindítás csak első aktiváláskor; már aktív 1.2.19 vagy V4.4.2 óta.","ru":"Новые панели управления, внешняя катушка без Canvas, Spoolman, сохранение LAN-кода, уведомление о завершении, фильтры и экспериментальный нагрев по таймеру. Камера: перезапуск только при первом включении; уже активна с 1.2.19 или V4.4.2.","zh":"新版控制面板、无Canvas时外部耗材加载/卸载、可选Spoolman、保存LAN码、打印完成通知、耗材记录筛选及实验性定时热床加热。包含摄像头修复，仅首次启用需完整重启；1.2.19或V4.4.2已启用。"}},{"version":"1.2.22","firmware":"4.4","channel":"canvas-uds","url":"https://github.com/Neme77/centauri-carbon-2-community/releases/download/CC2-Control-1.2.22-V4.4/CC2-Control-1.2.22-V4.4.cc2update","size":6308246,"notes":"New Dashboard/Control, external-spool Load/Unload without Canvas, optional Spoolman, remember LAN code, print completion, spool-history filters and experimental timed bed heating. Camera included: full reboot only on first activation; already active since 1.2.19 or firmware V4.4.2.","notes_i18n":{"en":"New Dashboard/Control, external-spool Load/Unload without Canvas, optional Spoolman, remember LAN code, print completion, spool-history filters and experimental timed bed heating. Camera included: full reboot only on first activation; already active since 1.2.19 or firmware V4.4.2.","it":"Nuovi Dashboard/Controllo, bobina esterna senza Canvas, Spoolman facoltativo, salvataggio codice LAN, fine stampa, filtri consumi e riscaldamento piatto temporizzato sperimentale. Webcam inclusa: riavvio completo solo alla prima attivazione; già attiva da 1.2.19 o firmware V4.4.2.","fr":"Dashboard/Contrôle renouvelés, bobine externe sans Canvas, Spoolman optionnel, code LAN mémoris